// Strategic Megaprojects & Joint International Consortia (16 Archetypes).
//
// Each project is anchored to a real owned region (ScenarioState), built across three
// funded stages (Feasibility & Design -> Core Construction -> Commissioning), and grants
// permanent NationalModifiers while the region is held and not ruined by war damage.
// Category exclusivity prevents stacking duplicate energy/infrastructure wonders on one nation.
// Allies or fellow International Organization members can join as Consortium Partners to
// share costs, accelerate construction, buffer key-good shortages, and earn a Partner
// Dividend while diplomatic alignment holds.
//
// Mods can add new projects, tune existing entries by id, or drop one with "remove": true.
